{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>為迎接APEC，深圳福田市民中心上演燈光秀。</p><p></p><p>深圳市民中心由周四晚起連續四晚，分別在7時、8時及9時上演「大鵬展翅飛向世界」主題燈光騷，在福田中心商業區43棟高樓270度環幕同步播放，民眾可透過微信小程序，預約到場觀賞。</p><p></p><p>而在深圳灣、人才公園、前海灣、深南大道等地標展出的「一軸兩灣三區」燈光夜景，亦已升級新增APEC主題內容。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:41:24.489090+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:20:39.945290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:34:45.989260+00:00","content_hash":"96b5041b523019a02c380d29496decd9d01c07823a236f20accb1e5248a20b93","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:41:24.489090+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}